  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3307.01 Reporting and Recordkeeping Requirements for Large MWC Units",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3307.01 Reporting and Recordkeeping Requirements for Large MWC Units. The reporting and recordkeeping requirements applicable to each large MWC unit shall be the same as specified in 40 CFR §60.59b, excluding the siting requirements under 40 CFR §60.59b(a), (b)(5) and (d)(11).\n\nSource. #6518-B, eff 5-29-97; ss by #7704, eff 6-7-02; ss by #9084, eff 2-2-08; ss by #11131, eff 7-18-16; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18",
